   "source": [
    "# AI & Machine Learning: Code, Train & Deploy\n",
    "## Week 8 — Regression and Music Popularity Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "**Syllabus focus:** regression; simple linear regression; multiple regression; model selection and evaluation.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Business context:** A platform may want to predict which artists or tracks will attract attention based on known features such as listener count, release age, genre, or playlist placement.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Capstone deliverable:** A baseline regression model for popularity prediction.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Learning objectives\n",
    "- fit a regression model to numeric outcomes\n",
    "- interpret coefficients and prediction output\n",
    "- evaluate prediction quality\n",
    "- understand the limits of popularity prediction in fairness problems\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression\n",
    "\n",
    "X = np.array([[5000], [12000], [18000], [24000], [32000], [50000]])\n",
    "y = np.array([12000, 28000, 43000, 50000, 64000, 98000])\n",
    "\n",
    "model = LinearRegression()\n",
    "model.fit(X, y)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Intercept:', model.intercept_)\n",
    "print('Coefficient:', model.coef_[0])\n",
    "print('Prediction for 25000 listeners:', model.predict([[25000]])[0])\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Interpretation\n",
    "The model estimates how much streaming performance changes as listener count increases. A high coefficient indicates that listener growth is strongly associated with future streams.\n"
  },
  {
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from sklearn.metrics import mean_absolute_error\n",
    "\n",
    "pred = model.predict(X)\n",
    "mae = mean_absolute_error(y, pred)\n",
    "print('Mean absolute error:', mae)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Challenge task\n",
    "Build a small regression model using a synthetic dataset where `playlist_inclusion` and `listener_count` influence streams. Interpret the output.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
